>that file with tar, I guess that after writing several tapes full you'll
>know what I mean. I know it was that hard to explain that tar is not a backup
>program at at least one site, where a user actually did this. When there were
>many more tapes written than possibly could have been on the disk, the 
>system administrator started to understand...

