	-> Nntp-Posting-Host: nephi-hbll.byu.edu

	-> We have an DEC Alpha Model 300.  We are trying to add
	-> entries to the terminal capabilities database for wyse50.
	-> It looks like OSF/1 uses the same conventions in termcap as
	-> Ultrix.  So I just put that entry from Ultrix into
