	-> entry.  When I try to load termcap/curses based programs
	-> such as vi it says "wyse50: Unknown terminal type".  So I
	-> tried putting the wyse information in $HOME/.termcap and
	-> the environmental variable TERMCAP with no success.


Your problem is that OSF/1 has both termcap and terminfo. Some
programs like tset are compiled against termcap and others like vi
need terminfo information. You need to install a terminfo entry into
/usr/share/lib/terminfo/... using tic or some other such program. That
should make vi happy.

-Jeff
